msgstr "科技园区｜静安区｜研究核对日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/shibei-valley.rst:8
msgid "AI and industry focus: Software AI, Industry."
msgstr "人工智能与产业方向：软件人工智能、产业。"

#: ../../entities/shibei-valley.rst:10
msgid ""
"Jing'an's 2026-2028 AI demonstration plan and district carrier program "
"anchor big-data, blockchain (Shutong Valley), cloud computing and "
"enterprise AI workspaces across Shibei Hi-Tech Park, Daning and Suhewan. "
"Confirm the specific carrier operator, data-compliance services and "
"tenancy terms."
msgstr "静安2026至2028年人工智能示范区方案及载体布局以市北高新园区、数通链谷、大宁及苏河湾为核心，集聚大数据、区块链、云计算与企业级人工智能空间。申请前应确认具体运营主体、数据合规服务与入驻条款。"

#: ../../entities/shibei-valley.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Evidence S053 "
"<https://www.jingan.gov.cn/govxxgk/JA2/2026-03-27/1b9b0944-356c-4561-b157-502a9e1af84d.html>`_. "
"静安区发展和改革委员会、静安区科技和经济委员会关于印发《静安区打造人工智能创新应用示范区三年行动方案（2026—2028年）》的通知."
msgstr "`证据 S053 <https://www.jingan.gov.cn/govxxgk/JA2/2026-03-27/1b9b0944-356c-4561-b157-502a9e1af84d.html>`_. 静安区发展和改革委员会、静安区科技和经济委员会关于印发《静安区打造人工智能创新应用示范区三年行动方案（2026—2028年）》的通知."

#: ../../entities/shibei-valley.rst:14
msgid ""
"`Evidence S054 "
"<https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw15343/20250310/f8c67876d6cb459f8c8d353d70fe3f31.html>`_. "
"静安大宁功能区举办“宁心荟”企业家沙龙暨优秀企业颁奖仪式｜营商in静安."
msgstr "`证据 S054 <https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw15343/20250310/f8c67876d6cb459f8c8d353d70fe3f31.html>`_. 静安大宁功能区举办“宁心荟”企业家沙龙暨优秀企业颁奖仪式｜营商in静安."

#: ../../entities/shibei-valley.rst:16
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "状态与支持"

#: ../../entities/shibei-valley.rst:19
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构有来源，招募待确认"

#: ../../entities/shibei-valley.rst:21
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "本条未核实统一现金资助、免费权益或股权比例，请索取现行书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/shibei-valley.rst:23
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系与位置"

#: ../../entities/shibei-valley.rst:26
msgid ""
"`Official evidence and authority route "
"<https://www.jingan.gov.cn/govxxgk/JA2/2026-03-27/1b9b0944-356c-4561-b157-502a9e1af84d.html>`_"
msgstr "`官方来源与主管部门入口 <https://www.jingan.gov.cn/govxxgk/JA2/2026-03-27/1b9b0944-356c-4561-b157-502a9e1af84d.html>`_"

#: ../../entities/shibei-valley.rst:28
msgid ""
"A direct program phone or email is not verified here. Use the official "
"route and request the responsible team; no contact has been invented."
msgstr "本版未核实项目直线电话或邮箱。请通过官方渠道索取负责团队，本图谱不编造联系人。"

#: ../../entities/shibei-valley.rst:30
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图位置使用区级或校区锚点，并非核实后的办公室位置。"

#: ../../entities/shibei-valley.rst:32
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/shibei-valley.rst:35
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/shibei-valley.rst:37
msgid "Send a project brief and request the current admission checklist."
msgstr "发送项目简介，索取现行入驻清单。"

#: ../../entities/shibei-valley.rst:39
msgid ""
"Complete the operator's eligibility and technical or commercial review."
msgstr "完成运营方资格及技术或商业评审。"

#: ../../entities/shibei-valley.rst:41
msgid ""
"Confirm rent, service fees, IP, compute pricing and any equity rights in "
"writing."
msgstr "书面确认租金、服务费、知识产权、算力价格及任何股权权利。"

#: ../../entities/shibei-valley.rst:43
msgid ""
"Sign the agreed admission documents and record milestones and support "
"owners."
msgstr "签署入驻文件，记录里程碑与服务负责人。"

